{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Business from Your Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a young entrepreneur starting from scratch in your own room. Buy and sell products to earn money, deliver them on time, and expand your catalog with more profitable items. Keeping your customers satisfied is the key to growing your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/9a7310d344109587834c7634e444b30f.poster.avif?t=1766670057\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/9a7310d344109587834c7634e444b30f.webm?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/9a7310d344109587834c7634e444b30f.mp4?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check orders every day, carefully prepare your products, and ship them on time. Fun mini-games determine the quality of your packaging \u2014 the better you pack, the higher your store rating will climb. Poor packaging, on the other hand, can lead to bad reviews and unhappy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night comes, finish any remaining packages and make sure to pay your bills and rent. To grow your business and stay competitive, you\u2019ll need to make smart choices and manage your time wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.poster.avif?t=1766670057\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.webm?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.mp4?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Entrepreneur Experience</strong> \u2013 Start from a small room and build your own business by buying and selling products.<br>\u2714 <strong>Packaging Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Play interactive mini-games to pack products securely and ensure customer satisfaction.<br>\u2714 <strong>Customer Reviews &amp; Store Rating</strong> \u2013 Your packaging quality directly impacts your store\u2019s reputation.<br>\u2714 <strong>Time Management Challenges</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, finish orders at night, and keep up with your bills.<br>\u2714 <strong>Competitive Market</strong> \u2013 Prove yourself against other businesses and claim your place in the industry.<br>\u2714 <strong>Progression &amp; Growth</strong> \u2013 Unlock more profitable products and expand your operations step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/ff94a947b43c829efd7477d393504471.poster.avif?t=1766670057\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/ff94a947b43c829efd7477d393504471.webm?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/ff94a947b43c829efd7477d393504471.mp4?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready to Become the Best Store?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every order is an opportunity, and every customer review shapes your future. Make the right decisions, outpace the competition, and prove yourself as the ultimate entrepreneur. Are you ready?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Sale!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/73580714607c7cb116398f6ab91901c97d14db35.jpg"},{"name":"Bookworm!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/b46c854e42292a5e6e4407fa242e0c4f44c77bc6.jpg"},{"name":"Product Expansion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/299a37bde579bdf03af86702d35759507f433e62.jpg"},{"name":"Small Business!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/098fd20b2f5ac4fc44680de7aa355f1cb6216249.jpg"},{"name":"Packing Prodigy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/b869221c7b484104b7d512352d62d98d061a702d.jpg"},{"name":"Express Delivery!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/23561ec043a4347c1839ea315ba0230e835edd64.jpg"},{"name":"Full Truck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/fd98ae96bddffb70e4454472af17d92e5457a2ff.jpg"},{"name":"PR Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/4a5fa42014050770b6ec437dd782ae555b39d3e4.jpg"},{"name":"Opps!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/547cd36e98a036c1de32649bbb66cb795e1ce898.jpg"},{"name":"Late Night Hustle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979100/28aadd27b4f7a546e1fa73da1d9b38e03a9c4fb9.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979100?t=1766670057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/04a60a8fc1e76a