eviews and unhappy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night comes, finish any remaining packages and make sure to pay your bills and rent. To grow your business and stay competitive, you\u2019ll need to make smart choices and manage your time wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.poster.avif?t=1766670057\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.webm?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979100/extras/836077c93e1f9aad2df32aec3388d797.mp4?t=1766670057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Entrepreneur Experience</strong> \u2013 Start from a small room and build your own business by buying and selling products.<br>\u2714 <strong>Packaging Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Play interactive mini-games to pack products securely and ensure customer satisfaction.<br>\u2714 <strong>Customer Reviews &amp; Store Rating</strong> \u2013 Your packaging quality directly impacts your store\u2019s reputation.<br>\u2714 <strong>Time Management Challenges</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, finish orders at night, and keep up with your bills.<br>\u2714 <strong>Competitive Market</strong> \u2013 Prove yourself against other businesses and claim your place in the industry.<br>\u2714 <strong>Progression &amp; Growth</strong> \u2013 Unlock more profitable products and expand your operations step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared